extra people involved to make space for DeBoard But I do think it almost always requires some effort some sort of Reconfiguration of people's expectations on on how and when they can reach you So I'm gonna ask your question now that's part serious and part teasing You and I was scheduled to talk last week, and you didn't get the appointment down in your calendar, and I was sitting here waiting for you,

